OL,3,ARussian drone attack on Ukrainian train
OL,4,Astation kills at least 13, officials
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FThirteen people have been killed after
OL,8,Fa Russian jet-powered drone hit a
OL,9,Fcrowded platform at Dnipro railway
OL,10,Fstation in the country's north,
OL,11,FUkrainian officials have said.
OL,13,FDnipropetrovsk regional head Oleksandr
OL,14,FHanzha said at least 10 others were
OL,15,Fwounded in the attack, including an
OL,16,F11-year-old boy.
OL,18,FAccording to the Ukrainian railway
OL,19,Foperator, Ukrzaliznytsia, a train
OL,20,Fheaded for Zaporizhzhia was at one of
OL,21,Fthe platforms in Dnipro when the drone
OL,22,Fhit.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
